# Donorbox

> Donorbox is a comprehensive fundraising platform that helps nonprofits and other mission-driven organizations collect online and in-person donations, manage donor relationships, run campaigns and events, and build recurring support.

Donorbox serves organizations of different sizes and cause areas. Its fundraising suite includes donation forms and pages, recurring donations, peer-to-peer fundraising, crowdfunding, memberships, event ticketing, donor management, a nonprofit CRM, text giving, QR-code giving, and in-person payment tools. Use the linked product pages as the source of truth for current features, eligibility, availability, integrations, and plan details.

